# Allow-list: send the build exactly what the image needs. Everything else stays
# out -- raw data (never shipped, see "Data provenance" in README), local model
# files (the build fetches the pinned ones), the local .venv (built for macOS,
# useless on Linux), notebooks, caches, git history.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!scripts/fetch_model.py
!deploy/hub.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
